---
description: Project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Internal ERP-lite system (single company, single main inventory).

Rules:
- Always plan before coding
- Use TypeScript
- Use PostgreSQL with Prisma
- Keep code clean and modular; business logic in `src/server/services/`
- Use Mongolian language in UI
- Add audit log for important actions
- Never mutate stock or balances directly — write a ledger entry
- Cancel/reverse financial records instead of deleting them
- Validate permissions on the server for every protected operation
- Do not break existing code
